Supply and Provide Counseling
Counseling is a vital step in the dispensing process. This is to ensure that the patient will have sufﬁcient information to
understand their drugs and intended therapeutic effects. Always give the patient the opportunity to ask any questions and
clarify any information. In counseling, discuss the following:
l
what the drug is used for;
l
how the drug works;
l
how to take drug, use devices, and measure doses;
l
when to take the drug;
l
how long to continue taking the drug;
